<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Thuhriltu</book>
  <para style="h">Thuhriltu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuhriltu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuhriltu</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuhriltu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem lal, Davida fapa, Thuhriltu thute chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuhriltu chuan: A va ho tehlul êm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni sa hnuaiah hah takin hna kan thawk a, Eng nge a hlâwkna awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhuan khat an liam a, chhuan dang an lo awm a, Lei erawh chu a awm ngaiin a awm reng si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni a chhuak a, a tla leh a, A chhuahna lam a pan leh thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhim zâwngin thli a tleh a, Hmâr zâwngin a tleh kual a, A tleh kual vêl mai mai a, A kalna ngai bawkah a lêt leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lui zawng zawng tuifinriatah a luang lût a, Tuifinriat lah a liam chuang lo, Tui chu a kîr leh a, A luanna ngai bawkah a luang leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ninawm ngei mai, sawi sên a ni lo, Thil hmuh kan kham thei lo va, Kan beng pawh a tlai thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil awm tawh chu a lo awm leh ang a, Tih tawh pawh chu an ti leh ang, Vân hnuaiah thil thar rêng a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘En teh, hei chu thil thar a ni,’ Tih tûr rêng a awm em? Hmânlai ata, kan awm hma daiha awm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûn hma thil chu tu man an hre reng lo, Tûnlai thil lah nakina mite chuan An hre reng bawk hek lâwng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei, Thuhriltu hi, Jerusalem-ah Israel-te lal ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân hnuaia thil thlengte hi ka finna hmanga chhuia, dap chhuah ka tum ta a. Pathianin mihring buaipui tûra a pêk hi hna hrehawm tak a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vân hnuaia thil tih zawng zawng hi ka hmu vek a, engkim mai hi a va ho êm! Thli man tum ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kawi chu tihngîl theih a ni lo, A awm lo chu chhiar theih a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem-a lal tawh zawng zawng aiin ka fing zâwk daih a, finna leh hriatna ka ngah zâwk ka ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Finna hi hriat ka tum a, thil ho leh thil âtthlâk pawh hriat ka tum a, chu pawh chu thli man tum ang mai a ni tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan fin poh leh lungkham tûr kan ngah a, kan hriat poh leh manganna tûr a tam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />‘Nawmsip bâwlin nuam ka han tâwl teh ang,’ ka ti a. Chu pawh chu a ho khawp mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuih hi a âtthlâk hle a, intihhlim pawh a sâwt lo hle tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uain nêna intihhlima nuam tâwl hi vân hnuaia mihring dam chhûng rei lo tê an hman dân tûr ṭha ber a ni law maw, a finthlâk nge thlâk loh chhin ka tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nasa takin hna ka thawk a, in te ka sa a, grep huan te ka siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan nuam tak tak ka nei a, thei tinrêng ka phun bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A châwm nân dîl ka khuap a, thing a ngaw khup mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawih atân mipate leh hmeichhiate ka lei a, ka in chhûnga piang ngawt pawh an tam mai; ka hmaa Jerusalem lal zawng aiin ran leh berâm rual ka ngah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka chhiah ram leh an lalte ro khâwl khâwm tangka leh rangkachak te chu ka lâksak a; zai thiam nula leh tlangvâl ka nei ṭeuh va, nula duhawm tak tak ka ngah bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka awm hmaa Jerusalem-a lo awmte chu ka khûm vek a ni, ka fin ka chhawr hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh chu ka hlah ngai lo va, a nuam tûrah ka insûm ngai hek lo; ka tih apiangah ka lâwm a, ka hah man chu ka têl zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thiltihte leh ka hahziate ka han thlîr kîr a, a lo ho mang e, thli man tum ang mai a ni, vân hnuaiah eng mah rêng hlâwk a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Finna kan tih te, âtthlâk leh mâwl kan tihte hi ka chhui ngun a. Lal meuh pawhin lal dang lo tih ṭhin bâk chu a ti thei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fin chu ât ai chuan a ṭha, thim ai chuan êng a ṭha zâwk tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi fing chuan a kalna a hria a, mi â erawh chu thimah a kal ṭhîn; mahse, an pahniha chungah khawrêl thuhmun a thleng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi â-te chan ang bawk ka chan tho dâwn si chuan fin eng nge a sâwtna? “A sâwt hauh lo,” ka ti rilru a. Hei pawh hi ho tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu man mi â an hre reng lo ang bawk hian mi fing an hre reng chuang lo; nikhua a lo rei a, an theihnghilh mai; mi fing pawh mi â pawh kan thi vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nun hi ka ning ta, vân hnuaia thiltih apiang hi ninawm mai a lo ni, ho tak vek a ni a, thli man tum ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni sa hnuaia ka thawhrimna leh ka hahna hi ka kham ngei mai, ka thawh chhuah chu mi dangin an nei dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A neitu tûr chu mi fing nge mi â tu ma hriat a ni lo, ka thawh chhuah zawng zawng chu a la nei dâwn si a, ka fin avânga ka deh chhuah zawng zawng chu a khâwm vek dâwn a ni. A va ho êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni sa hnuaia hah taka ka lo thawk ta kha ka inchhîr rum rum mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fing tak leh remhre taka mi themthiam hnathawh rah chu eng mah thawk hauh lovin a rochung hlauh si ṭhîn. Hei pawh hi ho tak, dik lo tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni sa hnuaiah miin hah takin thawk mah se a tân a sâwt em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A dam chhûng chu buaina leh manganna hlîrin a khat a, zânah pawh a muhîl thei lo. Hei pawh hi a va ho êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Duh tâwka ei leh in lo liama ṭha mihring tân a awm lo, a hah man chên rawh se. Hei pawh hi Pathian ruat a ni tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thu lo chuan tu nge tui ti taka eia, nuam chên thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah tilâwmtu chu Pathianin finna te, hriatna te a pe a; thil sual titute erawh chu, Pathian tilâwmtute rochun atân thil a zawn khâwmtîr a, a chhêk khâwmtîr ṭhîn. A va ho êm, thli man tum ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vân hnuaia thil tinrêng tân hun bi ruat a ni a, Remchân hun bîk a nei ṭheuh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pian hun a awm a, thih hun a awm a, Phun hun a awm a, kar leh hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tihhlum hun a awm a, tihdam hun a awm, Ṭhiat hun a awm a, sak hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭah hun a awm a, nuih hun a awm, Lusûn hun a awm a, lâm hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lung paih hun a awm a, chhar khâwm hun a awm. Inpawm hun a awm a, inpawm loh hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmuh hun a awm a, hloh hun a awm, Khâwl khâwm hun a awm a, paih hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawh thlêr hun a awm a, ṭhui hun a awm. Ngawih hun a awm a, ṭawng hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inhmangaih hun a awm a, inhuat hun a awm. Indo hun a awm a, inrem hun a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rim taka thawh hi eng nge a sâwtna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianin kan thawh tûr a ruat hi a hahthlâk hle tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thil engkim tân hun ṭha a ruat a ni. Tûn hma leh tûn hnu hriatchâkna min pe a; mahse, a bul leh a tâwp thlengin Pathian thiltumte kan hre vek thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng hian hlim taka kan thawh tûr thawh hi kan tih theih tâwk a ni tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan thawh chhuah hi kan eiin kan in ang a, kan chên tûr a ni, Pathian thilpêk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian thiltih rêng rêng a awm hlen dâwn tih ka hria, eng mah kan belh thei lo va, kan paih thei hek lo. Amah kan ṭih theih nân hêng hi Pathianin a ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil awm rêng rêng awm tawh sa a ni a, lo thleng tûr pawh thleng tawh sa vek a ni. Pathianin a ngai bawk a thlen nawntîr leh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vân hnuaia thil ka hmuh bawk chu hei hi a ni: Hleih neih lohna leh dik taka rêlna tûr hmuna sualna awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Pathian chuan mi dik leh mi sual chungah ro a rêl dâwn; engkim tân hun remchâng a siam a, a tih hun pawh a ruat bawk,’ tih hi ka hmuh dân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramsa ang chauh kan nih kan hriat theih nân Pathianin min fiah niin ka ngai ta bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihring leh ramsa chungah khawrêl thuhmun a thleng dâwn, an thi ve ve dâwn si a. An thaw thei ve ve a, mihring nih hlâwkna a awm chuang lo, engmahlo mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An lo chhuahnaah bawk an kîr leh dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring thlarau chu a chho vang a, ramsa thlarau chu leiah a chhuk dâwn tih tu nge hria?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kan thawh chhuah duh tâwka chen aia ṭha a awm chuang lo tih ka hre ta; chu chu kan chanpual tûr a ni: chu bâk chu thil eng nge lo thleng dâwn tu nge hre thei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vân hnuaiah intihduhdahna a tamzia ka hmu bawk. Tihduhdahte chu an ṭap a, tu man an thlamuan lo; a tiduhdahtute chuan thil an ti thei êm êm a; chuvângin, puitu an nei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thi tawhte chu nungdama la awmte ai chuan nihlawh zâwk hlein ka ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng ai maha chan ṭha chu la piang ve lo, vân hnuaia thil ṭha lo la hmu ve hman lote hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An theih tâwka miin rim taka hna an thawh chhan pawh ka hre ta; an ṭhenawmte an awh vang a ni; hei pawh hi ho tak a ni, thli man tum ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thawh peih loh vânga rilṭâma thih chu âtthlâk tak a ni tih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thli man tum anga, ṭhûm neih tuma phili sek ai chuan hahdam taka vei khat neih a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vân hnuaiah thil ho dang ka hmu bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fa pawh nei lo, unau pawh nei lo, mahni chauhva awm si, rim taka thawk reng mai, hausa inti ngai lo a awm, a duhzâwng pawh a ei ngam lo va, tu tân nge a thawh tih pawh a ngaihtuah lo. A va hovin a va retheihthlâk thlâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahni maia thawh ai chuan thawhpui neih a ṭha, hlawhtlin a awl zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pakhat a tlûk chuan pakhatin a kaitho thei a, mahni chauhva thawk chu tlu palh sela a vânduaithlâk hle ang, kaitho tûr tu mah an awm dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahnih chu mutnaah an innghêng lum thei, mahni chauh chuan tu nge mu lum thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pakhat hneh loh chu pahnih chuan an hneh ang. La zai thum kawp chu a chat mai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naupang rethei fing tak si chu thurâwn ngaithla duh lo lal tar tawh ai chuan a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhûngkaw rethei tak aṭangin emaw, tân in aṭangin emaw a ramah chuan lalah a lo la ṭang mai thei tih a hre lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vân hnuaia mihringte hi ka ngaihtuah a, an zînga naupang tuin emaw lal ai chu a la awh dâwn tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chu chhiar sên loh chungah lal mah sela a thih hnu chuan a chungah tu mah an lâwm chuang lo. A va ho êm! Thli man tum ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ina i kalin fîmkhur ang che; mite chuan thil ṭha an ti nge ti lo tih ngaihtuah lovin thil an hlân a, chutianga tih ai chuan ngaithla tûra kal a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu thlah mai mai suh, Pathian hnêna thutiam mai chîng hek suh; vânah daih Pathian chu a awm a, nang leiah i la awm si; chuvângin, a ṭûl lo chu sawi mai mai suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungkham i ngah poh leh mangphan tur i ngah a, thu tuitam vak pawh thu â tak tak phuh chhuahna mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian hmaa thu i tiam chuan hlen hreh suh, mi â chungah a lâwm si lo; i tiam chu hlen mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tiam zeta hlen loh ai chuan tiam loh law law a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I thutiam avângin thiam loh chang suh, ‘Pathian tirhkoh hmaah ka ṭawng sual palh a ni,’ i tih a ngai dah ang e. Engah nge i thutiam avânga Pathian a thinur anga, i thiltih a tihchhiatsak vek ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mumang i ngah pawhin engah mah a ni lo, i ṭawng ṭeuh pawhin a sâwt hek lo. Pathian ṭih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram chhûnga thuneituin retheite a nêk chêp a, dik taka ro a rêl duh hauh loh chuan mak ti lêm suh, a aia sâng zâwkin a hum a, an aia sâng lehzual humtu an awm zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Mipui vântlâng tân a ni,’ an tih te, ‘Lal rawngbâwl nân a ni,’ an tihte i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangka ngaina chuan tâwk tih a nei lo; hausak châk chuan hlêp chin tâwk a nei hek lo. Hei pawh hi ho tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi an hausak leh a tlântu an pung a, a hausakzia mita a hmuh mai loh chu a tân eng nge a hlâwkna awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ei tûr an ngah emaw, ngah lo emaw hna thawk mi chu tui takin a mu thei a; an ngah êm avângin mi hausa erawh chu rilru hahin an mu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân hnuaia thil pawi tak ka hmuh chu hei hi a ni: miten mamawh hun atân tiin sum an khâwl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vânduaithlâk takin peipun an tumna lamah an chân ta vek mai hi. Fa nei siin hnutchhiah tûr eng mah an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An nu pum ata an lo chhuak angin saruak bawkin khawvêl an chhuahsan ang - an thawhrim rah eng mah an chhawm thei dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hei pawh hi pawi tak a ni. Kan lo kal lam ang bawkin kan kîr leh ang; kan thawhrim hi eng nge a sâwtna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng ni zawng zawng hi thim hnuaia khawsain bawrhsâwm mangang leh thinrim ṭeuhvin kan hmang ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hei hi ka thil hmuh chhuah a ni: Pathianin dam chhûng hun tawi tê min pêkah hian kan thawhrim rah chêna ei leh in hi thil ṭha ber leh âwm ber a lo ni; chu chu kan tâna khawrêl chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathianin sum leh pai min pêk kan chen theihnate hi Pathian thilpêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathianin hlim theihna min pêk avâng hian kan dam chhûng tawizia kan lungkham lêm ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vân hnuaiah hian thil ṭha lo tak, mihring tâna âwm lo zet ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianin mi ṭhenkhat chu sum leh pai a pe ṭeuh va, an neinungin miin an ngaisâng a, an duhzâwng eng mah tlâkchham an nei lo; mahse, Pathianin chûng chu an chen zu phal si lo va! Mi dang daihin an chên hlauh zâwk ṭhîn. A va hovin a va âwm lo êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miin fa za a nei a, a dam rei hle a, a kum tam hle mah se, a duhzâwng thil ṭha kham khawp a nei lo va, phûmtu mumal pawh a nei lo; chu mi ai chuan hlamzuih pawh nihlawh zâwkah ka ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlamzuih lo piang chu sâwt lo tak a ni, thim panin a kal leh nghâl a, hming lah a nei hman hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni êng a hmu lo va, eng mah a hre hman lo; mahse, a châwl ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum sâng dam nawna thil ṭha chên si lo ai chuan a chan a ṭha zâwk, an kalna tûr a inthuhmun reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihringin rim taka hna an thawh hi an hrawk tân chauh a ni; mahse, duhtâwk an nei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi fing nih hi mi â nih aiin a hlâwk em ni? Nun dân tûr a hriat avângin mi rethei tân sâwtna eng nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Duhthusâm neih si loh ai chuan neih saa lungawi a ṭha zâwk. Chu pawh chu ho tak a ni, thli man tum ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lo awm tawh phawt chu an hming vuah sa a ni; mihring awm dân tûr chu hriat sa a ni; an aia ropui chu an sawisêl thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sawisêl chiam mah se an tân a sâwt chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng tawi tê, ho tak, hlim anga ral mai tûr tâna thil ṭha ber chu tu nge hria? Kan thih hnuah khawvêlah hian thil eng nge lo awm dâwn tih tu nge hria?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hming ṭha hi hriak rimtui tak aiin a ṭha, Pian ni aiin thih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zu hmuna kal aiin lusun ina kal a ṭha, La damte hi thi mai tûr kan nih hriat fo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nuih ai chuan lungngaih a ṭha, Hmêl tingui mah se thinlung a siam ṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi â chuan hlimna ngawt a ngaihtuah a, Mi fing erawh chuan thih thu a ngaihtuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi â fak nih ai chuan Mi fing zilhna ngaihthlâk a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi â nui chu thuka hlîng kâng puak ang lek hi a ni, Ho tak bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi fingin mi bum a chîn chuan thil âtthlâk tak a ti a ni, Thamna lâkin mi a tichhia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil tâwpna chu a inṭanna aiin a ṭha, Dawh theih hi chapo aiin a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinur insûm theih hi a ṭha e, Mi â chuan a pai reng ṭhîn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engtizia nge tûnlai aiin hmânlai a ṭhat zâwk? ti suh, Zawhna âtthlâk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Finna neih hi roluah anga ṭha a ni, Nungdamte tân hlâwk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tangka ang bawkin finna hian mi a hum thei a, Finna neitute a hum ṭhîn a, Chu chu hriatna hlâwkna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian thiltih hi ngaihtuah teh, A tihkawih tawh chu tu nge tingîl thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil a kal tluan laiin lâwm la; buaina a lo thlenin hei hi ngaihtuah ngun rawh: hlimna leh buaina hi Pathian thlentîr a ni, thil lo thleng zêl tûr i hre thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng ho takah hian thil engkim ka hmu: Mi dik chu a dik avângin a thi a, mi sual chu a sual avângin a dam rei tlat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fing lutukin dik lutuk suh, engah nge mahni i intihchhiat ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sual lutukin â lutuk bawk hek suh, a hun thlen hmain engah nge i thih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A eng zâwk zâwk mah hi uar lutuk suh, Pathian ṭih phawt mai la, i hlawhtling zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawpuia hotu sâwm awm ai chuan finna hi mi fing tân chuan a ṭangkai zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leiah hian mi dik, thil ṭha tia, thil sual ti ngai hlek lo tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thu sawi nazawng bengkhawn suh, i chhiahhlawhin ânchhia a lawh che i hre dah ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nangmah ngei pawhin mi dang ânchhia i lawh ru fo ṭhîn tih i hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Finna hmangin hêng hi ka finfiah a, ‘Ka la fing ve ang,’ ka ti a; mahse, a teuh lo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thil a nih dân tak hi ka tân a thûk lutuk a, a khirh êm a, tu nge hmu chhuak phâk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, zira thil hre tûrin ka inhmang ta a, finna hi eng nge a niha, thil awm chhan bul eng nge ni? Mâwlna âtthlâkzia leh ṭhat lohzia hriat ka tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thil pakhat, thihna aia rapthlâk chu hmeichhe sual hi a ni tih ka chhar chhuak ta; mi a lêmna chu thang leh lên ang a ni a, mi a pawm chu khaidiata hlin ang a ni. Pathian tilâwmtu chu a lakah a him ang a, thil sual titu erawh chu a man tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuhriltu chuan, ‘Thil awmzia tlêm tlêmin ka hre ta tial tial a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ka duhthusam chu ka la hre lo na a, mi sâng zîngah mi ṭha mipa pakhat ka hmu hrâm a, hmeichhia erawh chu pakhat mah ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hei chiah hi ka hmuh chhuah chu a ni: Pathian hian mihring hi mi tluangtlam tak ni tûrin a siam a; mahse, keini hian kan intikhirhkhân zo vek a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi fing angin tu nge thil awmzia hria? Finna chuan hmêl a tihlim a, hmêl dur a tireh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian hnêna i thutiam avângin lal thu awih rawh ka ti a che, bawhchhe mai mai suh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thu thu-a thil a tih theih avângin thu dik lo a hmaah ṭan tlat suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal thu chu a lal ber a, tu mah chhuahchhâl thei an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thu i awih chuan i tuar lo vang; mi fing chuan a hun taka thil tih dân tûr dik a hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil tinrêngin ningkhâwng an nei zêl a, mihring mawhphurhna hi a rit hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil lo thleng tûr hre lâwk tu mah an awm lo va, min hrilh tûr lah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu mah mahni nunna chelh thei an awm lo, thih ni chunga thunei thei an awm hek lo. Indo laiin râlthuam dah theih a ni lo, mahni sualna laka intifihlîm thei kan awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng hi ka hmu vek a, vân hnuaia thil tih zawng zawng hi ka ngaihtuah a, ṭhenkhatin mi chungah thu an nei a, ṭhenkhatin an kut an tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sual, thlâna an phûm ka hmu a, thlân aṭanga hawte chuan thil sual a tihna khuaah chuan an fak a. A va ho êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hrem tûra tih tawh an hrem lawk loh avângin sualna a pung chak a, mihring thinlung chu thil sual tih duhnain a khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sual chuan thil sual vawi za ti mah se a la dam zêl mai; mahse, Pathian ṭihtute tân chuan thil a kal tluang ang tih ka hria, Pathian an ṭih si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi sualte tân eng mah a tluang lo vang, an nun chu hlim ang leka tawi a ni a, an dam rei lo vang: Pathian an ṭih si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawvêla thil awm, thil ho tak a awm bawk: mi dikte chuan mi sualte hremna tûr an tuar hlauh va, mi sualte lahin mi dikte lâwmman dawn tûr an dawng lawi si. Ho ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, nawmchen hi vân hnuaia thil ṭha ber niin ka ring ta tlat a ni; mihring tân ei leh ina mahni intihhlim lo liam hi thil dang ṭha a awm lo; khawvêla a dam chhûng hun atân Pathianin a ruatah rim taka thawh paha a tih theih chhun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fin ka tum a, khawvêl thil kalhmang hriat ka tum apiangin a chhûn a zan mut ka hmu ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vân hnuaia Pathian thiltih dân tinrêng hi ka hrethiam phâk lo. Hriatthiam tum chiam mah ila, kan hre thei chuang lo vang. Mi fingte chuan hriain insawi mah se, an lo hre bîk lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng thil zawng zawng hi thliar fel tumin ka ngaihtuah chiam a, mi dikte leh mi fingte thiltih rêng rêng, mi dang an hmangaihna leh an huatna chenin, Pathian thu thu a lo ni, tu mah thil hre lâwk thei an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tin chunga thil thleng a inang vek mai: mi dik leh mi sual, mi ṭha leh ṭha lo, mi thianghlim leh bawlhhlawh, inthawina hlân ṭhîn emaw, hlân duh lo emaw chungah khawrêl thuhmun a thleng vek a ni. Mi ṭha leh thil sual ti, chhechham ngam leh ngam lo an danglam chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An chunga khawrêl thuhmun thleng vek hi thil dik lo tak a ni. An dam chhûng chu mihring thinlung hi sualin a khat, an â hle a ni, rei lo têah an thi mai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nungdama awmte zînga la awm chuan beisei tûr an la nei; sakeibaknei thi ai chuan ui nung takngial pawh a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />La damte chuan thi tûr an nih an hria a, thi tawhte chuan eng mah an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi an hmangaihna te, an huatna te, an thîkthu te a ral vek tawh a, vân hnuaia thil tih rêng rêngah telna an nei ve tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ti rawh, hlim takin chaw ei la, uain pawh hlim takin in rawh; i thiltihah Pathian a lâwm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I silhfên chu fai reng sela, i lu chu hriak thih mawm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He khawvêla i nun ho tak, i dam chhûng hian i nupui duh tak nên nun chên mai rawh, chu chu rim taka i thawh, khawvêla i dam chhûng ho taka i chanvo neih chhun a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I kut thlâkna apiangah theihtâwp chhuah la, i kalna ngei tûr Seol-ah chuan thawh tûr te, ngaihtuah tûr te, hriatna te, finna te a awm dâwn tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka han thlîr kîr a, vân hnuaia thil dang ka hmuh chu hei hi a ni: intlânsiaknaa tlân chak chu a chak ber lem lo, indonaa mi huai chu hnehtu a ni kher lo; mi fingin ei tûr an ngah chuang lo, thil hria an hausa lem lo va, themthiamin duhsak an hlawh zêl bawk hek lo; tu tân pawh a hun leh khawrêl angin thil a thleng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihringin thil lo thleng tûr kan hre lo, thanga sava âwk leh lêna sangha tâng ang maiin thil ṭha lo kan chungah a thleng thut ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân hnuaiah hian miin finna an thlîr dân entîrna ṭha tak ka hmu bawk, ka ngai pawimawh hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khaw tê tak tê, mi tlêm tê awmna a awm a, lal ropui takin a rawn bei a, a hual a, dai a theu hnan tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu khuaah chuan mi rethei tak, fing deuh mai a awm a, a finnain khua chu a chhan chhuak ta a; mahse, chu mi chu, a retheih êm avângin tu man an hre reng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Finna hi tharum ai chuan a ṭha,’ ka ti a; mahse, mi rethei finna chu miin an hmusit a, tu man a thu an ngaithla duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi fingin zawi tê pawha thu a sawi ngaihthlâk chu mi â zînga hotu au vak vak ngaihthlâk ai chuan a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Finna hi râlthuam aiin a ṭha; Mi sual pakhatin thil ṭha a tichhe tam thei hle.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho thi chuan tel rimtui a bûr chawpin a tirimchhia. Âtna nêp tak pawhin Finna leh zahawmna a chhilh thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi fingin thil tih âwm a hria a, Mi â chuan a hre ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi â khawlai lêng chuan amah a inhre lo, A âtzia mi tin a hrilh lek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hotu i chunga a thinrimin tauhsan mai suh, Ngawih hian thil ṭha lo tam tak a tidai thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vân hnuaiah thil ṭha lo tak ka hmu: chu chu thuneitute tihfuh loh a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi â an dah sâng a, mi hausa an dah hniam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh sakawr chunga chuang ka hmu, chhiahhlawh anga mi lian kea a kal ka hmu bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hum i laih chuan i tla ang a, A bâwm i tihpawh chuan rûlin a chu ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung khura hna i thawh chuan Lungin a chilh ang che. Thing i eh chuan i la intipalh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hriamhrei bil i tah loh chuan A hman a hahthlâk ang. Thil ngaihtuah lâwk hi a hlâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dawi ât hmaa rûlin a chuk che chuan Dawi thiam nih sâwtna a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi fing chu ama thuin a chawimawi a, Mi â chu ama thuin a tichhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ṭawngkam chhuak hmasa chu a â hle a, A sawi zêl pawh a â tulh tulh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi â chu a pâwt mai mai a, Thil lo thleng tûr hria tu mah an awm lo. Thih hnua thil thleng tûr hria pawh an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi â chu hâwn nachâng hre lovin A inthawk chau hnêp ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naupang chu lal a niha, Hotute zîng aṭanga zu an ruih chuan, Ram chu a va khawngaihthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal chu mi pangngai fa a niha, Mi lianten a hun taka chaw an eia, Rui lova insûm thei an nih chuan Ram chu a va nihlawh êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In chung pawp thawm peih lotu in chu A far ang a, a chim mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ruai hian mi a tilâwm a, Uain hian nun a tihlim, Mahse, hêng thil atân hian tangka a ṭûl zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal chu i rilru pawhin ânchhia lawh suh, Pindan chhûngrilah pawh miliante ânchhia lawh hek suh, Chunglêng savaten i thu chu an thlawhpui ang a, An va hrilh mai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I buh chu tuipuiah tawlh chhuak la, A hlâwkna i la têl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo khawvêla thleng tûr i hre lo va, Kawng sarih kawng riatah i neih chhep rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhûm a chhah chuan ruah a sûr ṭhîn, Hmâr zâwngin emaw, chhim zâwngin emaw Thing chu a tlûk dân ang angin a awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Duhthusâm anga khaw awm i nghah chuan Buh tuh hun emaw, seng hun emaw i hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thli tlehna tûr i hre lo ang leh Nu puma nau insiam dân i hre lo ang bawk hian, Pathianin thil engkim a siam dân i hre pha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zîngah buh tuh la, tlaiah pawh tuh rawh, A ṭo ṭhat vek dâwn leh dâwn loh i hre si lo. Zînga tuh nge ṭha tlaia tuh i hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Êng hi a hmuh a nuam a, Ni Êng hmuh theih hi a ṭha e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I dam rei leh lâwm zêl la, Thim lo thleng tûr chu a rei dâwn tih hre reng rawh, Eng mah beisei tûr dang a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhalaite u, in ṭhat lai hun hi chên ula, In la naupan lai hian hlim takin awm rawh u. In duhzâwng chu ti ula, Ṭha in tih angin awm rawh u. Amaherawhchu, in thiltih ang zêlin in chungah Pathianin ro a rêl dâwn tih hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engto eng mah nei suh ula, Intibuai duh hek suh u. In ṭhat lai ni a liam mai dâwn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I vânglai hian i siamtu chu hre reng ang che, Hun ṭha lo, tarchhiat hun, ‘Dam pawh nuam ka ti tawh lo,’ i tih hma hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan ni te, thla te, Arsi êng te i hmu ṭha thei lo vang a, Ruah sûr zawhah pawh i tân chhûm a la kiang chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I invênna, i bân chu a khûr ang a, I ke chak tak chu a la zawi ang. I hâ a bal tam avângin thil i ṭhial thei lo vang a, I mitin thil a hmu fiah hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I beng a ngawng ang a, Kawtthlêra thâwm i hre lo vang. Buh her thâwm leh ṭingṭang ri I hre che che emaw a ni ang a, Sava hrâmah pawh i ṭhangharh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmun awih i hlau vang a, Kal pawh i zuam lo vang. I lu a ṭuak ang a, I che hrâm hrâm thei chauh vang a, Tisa châkna i nei tawh hek lo vang, I chatuan inah i kal dâwn tawh a, Khawlaiah an ṭah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tangkaraw zai chu a chat ang a, Rangkachak no chu a keh ang, Tuikhura tuibêl chu a keh ang a, Khai chhuahna hrui chu a chat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaivut chu leiah a kîr leh dâwn a, A petu Pathian hnênah thlarau pawh a kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuhriltu chuan, ‘A va ho êm! ho tak vek a lo ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuhriltu chu a fing hle a, a hriat chu mi a zirtîr ṭhîn a, thufing tam tak a zir a, a fiah a; thu khirhte pawh a hriat awl zâwngin a dah rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuhriltu chuan thu lem nuamte a zawng a, mahse a thu ziakte hi a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi fingte thu sawi chu berâmpu tiang zum, berâm khalhna ang hi a ni; thufing an lâk khâwmte pawh chu thîrkilhna khen bûr tlat anga awm reng tûr a ni, min vêngtu Pathian pêk vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka fapa, thil dang pakhat thlîr ngun tûr a la awm! Lehkhabu-ah engkim ziak sên a ni lo, zir tam hian a tihah lutuk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng khaikhâwmna hi i han ngaithla teh ang: Pathian ṭih la, a thupêkte zâwm rawh, chu chu mihring siam chhan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian chuan kan thiltih apiang, a chhia emaw, a ṭha emaw, a rûka kan tih chen hian a rêl dâwn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
